	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Reeds and other grasses become a helpful tool in your hands. By spending 1 hour weaving grasses together, you may create a temporary shelter for you and your allies. This shelter repels rain and keeps Supply and up to 4 Medium or smaller creatures dry. This shelter lasts for 1 week, at which point it degrades and falls down.</p>",
